"test":{"name":"script-subject-ambush","kind":"rules","opponent":"Human","rounds":"4","check":"scriptSubjectAmbush","question":"{unit}, Order Units in cover, Ambush, Mark Reach, Attack Proposed, Spawn out of sight: a Red grunt steps within 1 of (0,0), and the Blue tank ordered at {unit} goes for that grunt, not the nearer one; ordered at the nearest Red unit in cover 2 or more, it goes for the grunt in the forest, which fires first (Ambush for Red, its subject that grunt; none for Blue); selecting a Red grunt marks the forests it can reach this turn (and not one beyond), and selecting it again marks them afresh, 'reach*' hiding them all; Attack Proposed with Value 1 counts only a preview where the defender would fire first; with fog on, a grunt spawned out of sight stands on a tile Red cannot see, not on the tile asked for, which Red sees.","rules":"standard"},
